   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EUJUST LEX</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EUJUST LEX, European Union Integrated Rule of Law Mission for Iraq. To provide professional development opportunities for senior Iraqi officials from the criminal justice system in order to foster cooperation between the different branches of the criminal justice system. The costs for 2014 were remaining costs from 2013, as the Swedish assistance through the Swedish police to the mission ended on 31 december 2013.</narrative>
